  "prefLabel": "Eth 102.05 Constitutional official",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Eth 102.05 “Constitutional official” means “constitutional official” as defined in RSA 15-B:2, II, namely, “the secretary of state, the state treasurer, their deputies, assistants, and all employees of their departments.”\n\nSource. #12617-A, eff 9-6-18",
